  "question": {
    "text": "A helicopter is flying along the curve given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> A soldier positioned at the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;who wants to shoot down the helicopter when it is nearest to him. Then this nearest distance is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "5gjv6",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gddlr",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1w0jm",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mi> </mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
